  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db\">概述</span><br>为 276 个模组和原版添加发光矿石纹理，没有其他资源包支持的数量如此之多！更新会持续增加更多模组支持，欢迎提交请求 :)</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db\">我的愿景</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>我计划尽可能多地添加模组支持，以便您几乎可以在所有整合包中使用它。我已将此资源包设计为与不同模组版本高度兼容。</p>\n<p>如果您发现支持的模组中有任何矿石不发光或使用了过时的纹理，请留言说明您使用的模组名称、模组加载器以及 Minecraft 版本。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>发光矿石终极版 (Glowing Emissive Ores Definitive Edition):<br></strong></span></h2>\n<p>推荐尝试此资源包的模组版本。它经过优化，仅加载已安装模组所需的资产，与资源包版本相比大幅减少了加载时间。它还支持游戏内配置，可调整亮度或单独禁用特定矿石，且无需任何第三方发光模组。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glowing-emissive-ores-definitive-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glowing-emissive-ores-definitive-edition</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">⚠️ <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>前置要求：</strong></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">您可以使用我网站上的筛选工具，快速查找适用于您整合包的模组加载器和 Minecraft 版本的前置选项：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeftesthawk.github.io%252fglowing-emissive-ores%252frequirements-filter%252f%253fvariant%253dresource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://deftesthawk.github.io/glowing-emissive-ores/requirements-filter/</a>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">NeoForge 前置要求：</span></h3>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<h3>方案 1（1.21 和 1.21.1）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector&nbsp;</a>-（NeoForge 上运行 Continuity 所必需）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium&nbsp;</a>（NeoForge 版本，1.21.1+）或&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 2（1.20.3 至 1.21.11）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Fusion&nbsp;</a>-（需在 GEO 之前加载）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion (Connected Textures)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Forge 前置要求：</span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 1（1.16.5 至 1.21.1）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta Emissive Textures (Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 2（1.18.2 或 1.19.2）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connectedness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Connectedness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rubidium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rubidium</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 3（1.20.1、1.21 或 1.21.1）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector&nbsp;</a>-（Forge 上运行 Continuity 所必需）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 4（1.12 至 1.12.2 + 1.14 至 1.21.11）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Fusion&nbsp;</a>-（需在 GEO 之前加载）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion (Connected Textures)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 5（不推荐）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Fabric/Quilt 前置要求：</span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<h3>方案 1（1.18.2 至 26.2）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity&nbsp;</a>&ndash;（仅在 1.18.2 及以上版本支持发光纹理）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium&nbsp;</a>-（非必需，但我强烈推荐使用）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium&nbsp;</a>-（仅在使用低于 0.6 版本的 Sodium 时需要）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>&nbsp;已知低于 0.6 版本的 Sodium 与 Continuity 结合使用时会导致 Z 轴冲突（Z-fighting）问题。</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 2（1.16.5 至 1.21.1）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta Emissive Textures (Fabric)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 3（1.18 至 1.21.11）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Fusion&nbsp;</a>-（需在 GEO 之前加载）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion (Connected Textures)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>方案 4（不推荐）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optifabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFabric</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">🛠️ <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>帮助：</strong></span></span></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">您可以在我的网站上找到设置说明和故障排除帮助：</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeftesthawk.github.io%252fglowing-emissive-ores%252fhelp%252f%253fvariant%253dresource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://deftesthawk.github.io/glowing-emissive-ores/help/</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">✅ <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>支持的模组：</strong></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">您可以在我的网站上浏览和搜索完整的已支持模组列表：</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeftesthawk.github.io%252fglowing-emissive-ores%252fsupported%252f%253fvariant%253dresource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://deftesthawk.github.io/glowing-emissive-ores/supported/</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#169179\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#b96ad9\">请考虑在我的&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdeftesthawk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-Fi</a> 上捐赠，我为制作/更新此资源包投入了大量时间。</span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br>第三方资源包支持：</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>以下为我创建的用于支持第三方资源包的资源包列表。</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Excalibur</span> 可在官方 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qYZ9Pen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur Discord</a> 的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">MODS</span> / <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">royal-library</span> 频道中找到</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-industrial-revolution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Industrial Revolution Revamped</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-pixel-perfection-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Pixel Perfection Legacy</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-stay-true\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores - Stay True</a></p>\n</div>",
